  "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\n- **MCP Server**: Adds a Model Context Protocol server at `/api/mcp/mcp` exposing 50+ tRPC procedures as AI-callable tools via Streamable HTTP transport\r\n- **OAuth 2.1 + PKCE**: Full OAuth flow for MCP clients (dynamic registration, authorization, token exchange) alongside existing API key auth (`ApiKey` header + `Bearer` token)\r\n- **Scalar API Docs**: Replaces `swagger-ui-react` with `@scalar/api-reference-react` for interactive OpenAPI documentation with dynamic Mantine theme integration\r\n- **MCP Instructions UI**: New tabbed API page with endpoint info, auth methods, client configs (Cursor, Claude Desktop, VS Code Copilot, Claude Code), test command, and a dynamically generated tools table showing GET/POST type per tool\r\n- **Security**: Rate limiting on auth endpoints, capped in-memory OAuth stores, PKCE with constant-time comparison, tool execution error containment\r\n- **Developer Guide**: `.cursor/rules/mcp-integration.mdc` documents how to expose new tRPC procedures as MCP tools\r\n\r\n\r\n## Screenshots\r\n<img width=\"3184\" height=\"1874\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-06 at 18 00 24\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/79bb1f34-f131-4e15-97ec-10d4d46de37a\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n| Screenshots |\r\n|--------|\r\n| <img width=\"3410\" height=\"8177\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-06 at 17 53 07\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15d8358b-1aad-4b05-8297-b11ce68557cc\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"4336\" height=\"2654\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-06 at 17 52 47\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/28a17b7f-e57b-4970-9b55-52f002881e6f\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"3386\" height=\"5366\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-06 at 17 52 41\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d9b3b936-1f48-460c-a9d5-64d3fd6e10cb\" /> |\r\n\r\n\r\n## Test plan\r\n\r\n- [ ] Verify MCP endpoint responds to `initialize` and `tools/list` JSON-RPC calls with API key auth\r\n- [ ] Verify OAuth flow works end-to-end with `opencode mcp auth homarr` or similar client\r\n- [ ] Verify Scalar API docs render with correct theme in light/dark mode\r\n- [ ] Verify MCP instructions tab shows dynamic tool count and table\r\n- [ ] Verify \"Create API Key\" button in MCP tab opens the modal directly\r\n- [ ] Verify tools with `z.void()` input work correctly (no schema errors)\r\n- [ ] Verify rate limiting blocks after threshold on auth failure",
